        },
        {
          "text": " Nena na Haruni na wanawe, ili washughulikie kwa uangalifu vitu vitakatifu vya wana wa Israeli ambavyo wanitakasia mimi, tena wasilinajisi jina langu takatifu; mimi ndimi BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
